ook at you sideways. Did you know that? No, I had no idea. I thought that if I told the truth, and I let people know about the facts and the data that I had uncovered, that people would basically say, oh, you're right. This looks like a big problem. We need to stop the shots. And I told my wife after, you know, before I did this, I said, hey, this will be over in like two weeks. I mean, the data is so clear that this is going to be done in two weeks. And we're still at it after all this time. Don't take it, Max, to your... When you're a nurse and you're forced to take it to put food on the table? No, I was forced to take it. Yeah. You weren't forced to take it? Yes, I was. No, you weren't. I was. To hold my job, yeah, as a nurse. Nobody tied you down and put a fucking needle in your arm. Angela is the powerhouse nurse for the Vaccine Safety Research Foundation. What these injured need is number one, they need to be acknowledged. They need treatment. Have any of the doctors seen anything like this before? No. None of them have seen it. Multiple doctors tell me they've never seen this before, that it's just a coincidence that it's happening to me now. It's a coincidence that it happened at the same time of the vaccine. Yeah. When I get him to the new hospital, he has to get a tracheostomy and he's suffering from all this and the doctor comes in. His incisions aren't even healed up. He's struggling to breathe, having clamped on a venus and he said, hands me a form and says, I want to give him nine vaccines today. I've just created a marvelous new algorithm. It's called the CURS cumulative outcome ratio test. It's all about just taking objective data and you can just put this into the algorithm and it will tell you instantly whether something like the COVID vaccines saved lives or did it harm people. I've been looking at this data for two years and there is no benefit whatsoever from these COVID vaccines. In fact, they killed more people than they saved. How are you maintaining your optimism? What are your next steps and what are your personal fears and what resources do you have to continue to operate at this level when it's likely that the consequences will be quite serious? What gives me hope is that people are realizing it because they're seeing the death. 25% of Americans know someone who died from the vaccine. That's never supposed to happen. That's never happened for any shots in history. Look, in America, 42% of the people would join a class action against the vaccine companies. That would be the largest class action in history. You have to hold these people accountable for their actions. Thank you.",
